# API Base URL for DataFlowX frontend
# In local development or local Docker deployment, defaults to /api/v1 (relative, proxied by Vite or Nginx)
# For public Vercel deployment, configure the HTTPS URL of your deployed Spring Boot backend:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
